sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant App as App
  participant C as Central
  participant I as Index
  participant F as Feed
  App->>C: write record · fields + shape
  C->>C: validate + keep the shape
  C-->>App: shape accepted
  C->>I: append one row
  I-->>C: key
  C-->>App: record id
  Note over C,I: the schema lives with Central
  alt shape unknown
    C-->>App: rejected · app keeps its copy
    App->>C: retry with declared fields
    C->>I: append one row
    I-->>C: key
  end
  I->>F: one calm surface
  F-->>I: read cursor
  F-->>App: read back
  Note over C,F: one middle, not another app
